Z||000009||rogergarrison||08-26-2001||04:21 PM||||It had a Porsche transaxle, with halfshafts, so I guess thats why its pretty far forward. He put a scoop under the front and cut out the front valance to cool the radiator and the heat vents out of the hood louvers. Had a remote electric water pump. It also had no kind of a top, so all weather cruising is out. also notice, its got a current vehicle inspection sticker on windshield.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 08-26-2001).]||||reg||1
